ClamAV
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ClamAV is an open-source antivirus engine originally developed by Tomasz Kojm and now
maintained by Cisco Systems, Inc. It is distributed under the GNU General Public License,
version 2, with the ClamAV virus database under separate terms.

MYAV does not embed ClamAV. It invokes the `clamscan` / `clamdscan` binaries and reads the
signature database installed by the operating system's package manager. Users are
responsible for complying with ClamAV's licences when redistributing it.

  https://www.clamav.net/
  https://github.com/Cisco-Talos/clamav

