EICAR test file
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The EICAR antivirus test string is a standard, harmless test artefact published by the
European Institute for Computer Antivirus Research. It is used by `myav selftest` to prove
the detection chain. It is not malware and cannot execute.

  https://www.eicar.org/download-anti-malware-testfile/

